# Allowlist for settings-field-usage linter (SFU001 — dead field).
#
# Format:  <field_name><two-or-more-spaces><reason>
# A reason is MANDATORY (the linter rejects entries without one).
#
# Only add a field here if it has a LEGITIMATE non-attribute reader the AST
# scan can't see — e.g. accessed solely via getattr(settings, computed_name)
# or enumerated by settings.model_dump(). A field that is simply "for later"
# does NOT belong here: add it together with its consumer in the same PR
# (C1.3 / #173 migration rule). Empty today — all fields have a direct reader.
